msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Noodhkaas GPU ama GPU-gaas ma jiro, ama wuxuu ku yaallaa qalab aadan ogolaansho u lahayn."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "Weydiinta xogta GPU laguma dari karin qalabka. Hubi in qaababka kordhintu ay rakiban yihiin."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Qalabka: qalabka noodhka waa la tirtiray, sidaas darteed noodhka waxaa oo keliya laga dhigi karaa mid la damiyay."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Qalabka: dooro qalab Cacti ah oo jira."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Qalabka: qalabkani horay ayuu u yahay noodh GPU ah."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "Noodhka GPU waa la kaydiyay."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "Noodhka GPU lama kaydin karin."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Noodhka GPU waa la saaray. Qalabkiisii Cacti meeshiisii ayaa looga tagay."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Noodhka GPU lama saarin sababtoo ah diiwaannada GPU ayaa iska leh. Dami taa beddelkeeda; diiwaannada GPU weligood lama tirtiro."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "GPU-gu hadda wuxuu ka tirsan yahay noodhkii lagu arkay, isagoo wata taariikhdiisa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU-gu wuxuu la joogaa noodhkiisa diiwaangashan."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU-gu wuxuu ka bixi doonaa weydiinta xogta dib-u-tusmaynta xigta. Jaantusyadiisa iyo faylasha RRD waa la hayaa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "Kaliya GPU maqan ayaa laga saari karaa weydiinta xogta."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Abuurista qalab waxay u baahan tahay ogolaanshaha maamulka qalabka Cacti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Sharaxaadda: geli ilaa 150 xaraf oo la daabici karo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Magaca martigeliyaha: geli magac martigeliye ama ciwaan IP."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Qaabka qalabka ee GPU Node ma rakibna."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Qalabka lama hayn: koontadaadu ma arki karto qalabka ay abuurto. Waydiiso maamule inuu abuuro."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Qalabka lama saari karin ka dib markii ogolaanshaha la diiday. Waydiiso maamule inuu saaro."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Qalabka iyo noodhkiisa GPU waa la abuuray. Deji dejinta SNMP ee qalabka bogga qalabkiisa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
