#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "Kaydintu waxay ku dartaa weydiinta xogta GPU qalabka, iyada oo dib-u-tusmaynta tooska ah ee Cacti la damiyay: kordhintu waxay dib-u-tusmaysaa isbeddel kasta oo GPU ka dib. Marka hore habee wakiilka SNMP ee qalabka; eeg docs/node-setup.md."

#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Save"
