#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Absent GPUs"
msgstr "GPU-yada Maqan"

#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "GPU maqan wuxuu sii ahaadaa tusme ka mid ah weydiinta xogta, sidaas darteed jaantusyadiisa iyo faylasha RRD way ku xirnaadaan waxayna muujiyaan farqi. Ka saarista weydiinta xogta ayaa joojisa taas: dib-u-tusmaynta xigta Cacti mar dambe ma taxdo, jaantusyadiisu way joojiyaan cusboonaysiinta ilaha xogtiisana waxay u muuqdaan kuwo agoontobay, faylasha RRD iyo jaantusyadiisana waa la hayaa ilaa aad ka tirtirto. Diiwaanka GPU wuu sii jiraa, GPU-guna wuxuu ku soo noqdaa weydiinta xogta haddii mar kale la soo sheego."

