msgstr "U Calaamadee Maqan Ka Dib"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Tirada ururinta guuleysta ee isku xigta ee GPU lagu waayo ka hor inta aan loo calaamadin maqan, laga bilaabo 1 ilaa 100. Ururinta fashilantay, ama mid aan soo sheegin wax GPU ah, marnaba lama tiriyo. GPU-yada maqan waxay ilaashadaan diiwaankooda iyo taariikhdooda, marnaba si toos ah looma tirtiro."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Ururinta GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Duugooba Ka Dib"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada ka dib marka qalabku qaato muunad oo qiimaheedu joojinayaan in la sawiro garaafkeeda, laga bilaabo 60 ilaa 86400. Qiime ka weyn waxaa loo soo sheegaa mid aan la aqoon, si ururinta joogsatay ay u muuqato meel bannaan, marnaba sida xariiq siman. Qiimaha da'da GPU wuu sii socdaa tirinta si looga digo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Ilaali Jadwalka Plugin-ka Marka La Saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, ka-saarista barnaamij-ku-darka waxay ilaalinaysaa diiwaannada noodadka iyo GPU-yada. Ka saar calaamadda si ka-saaristu u tirtirto; marka hore ka dhoofi Noodadka GPU. Aaladaha Cacti, ilaha xogta, garaafyada, iyo faylasha RRD marnaba lama taabto labada dhinacba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar walxaha Cacti ee barnaamij-ku-darka marka laga saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, ka-saarista barnaamij-ku-darka waxay sidoo kale saaraysaa qaab-dhismeedka aaladda GPU, weydiinta xogta, qaab-dhismeedka xogta, iyo qaab-dhismeedyada garaafka ee uu soo dejiyay, mid walba kaliya marka wax ka baxsan barnaamij-ku-darku uusan isticmaalin, iyo XML-ka weydiinta xogta GPU ee uu qoray, kaliya haddii faylku uusan isbeddelin. Marnaba ma tirtiro faylasha RRD, aaladaha, garaafyada, ama ilaha xogta; qaab-dhismeedyada ay weli isticmaalaan waa la hayaa."

